<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4264" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ātīna</span></b> , ae. f., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄτινα</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I. A..</b>
			<i>A town in Latium</i>, still called <i>Atina</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 9, 28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 7,
				630</span></i>; cf. Mann. Ital. I. p. 675.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ātīnas</span></b> ,
				ātis, adj., <i>of Atina</i>, <i>Atinatic</i>, or <i>Atinatian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praefectura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Planc. 8</span></i>
			.— <b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in Atinati,</span>”
				<i>in the Atinatic territory</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 15, 3</span></i>
			.—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ātīnātes</span></b> ,
			ium, m., <i>the inhabitants
				of Atina</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Planc.
			8</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A</i>
			
			
			<i>town of the Venetians</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 19,
				23, § 131</span></i>; cf. Mann. Ital. I. p.
			95.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A town in Lucania</i>, now <i>Atena;</i> hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ātīnas</span></b> ,
			ātis, adj., <i>Atinatic</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in Atinate campo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 103, 106, § 225</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
